The Same Idea As `pdrive`, In The Browser: Browse The Drive, Download And Upload
Choosing Both What And Where, Pick A Conflict Policy, And See A --dry-run
Preview Before Anything Moves.

Serves On 127.0.0.1 Only. Standard Library Only (Python 3.9+), No Pip Install.
Requests Are Accepted Only With The Session Cookie That The One-Time Link
Printed At Startup Sets, From A Loopback Host, So Neither Another Local User
